WEBVTT

NOTE PraxisVerify website film. Narration taken word for word from the company tour recordings of 14 Nov 2026.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.300
PraxisVerify gives your regulatory documents
an independent review

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.300
by an expert who is experienced
in that type of document.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.900
You submit a document, we match it to an expert
with the right competence

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.400
and they review it in our secure viewer.
You get a report you can act on.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.300
Every expert has a verified identity,
works under a confidentiality agreement

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.700
and reviews against your procedures.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.700
Your documents are reviewed in our platform,
never sent out.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.300
Experts can't download them,
no cloud AI sees them.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.400
Every time the document is opened,
a record is kept.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
At Level 3, the expert signs off
with a qualified electronic signature.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.800
Anyone can check that signature
now or years from now.
